<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Indorama nine-month net down.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Indorama nine-month net down.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month to September 30</p>
<p>			  (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		     80.07 vs 97.20</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rph)     592 vs 848</p>
<p>    Net sales			464.31 vs 486.72</p>
<p>    Gross profit		   104.95 vs 159.25</p>
<p>    Operating profit		72.71 vs 132.54</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  83.52 vs 100.02</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	    296.36 vs 226.09</p>
<p>Note: The consolidated results were unaudited. PT Indorama Synthetics is one of the country's largest integrated polyester and resin producers.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
